<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= lesson.title %> | Studix01.net</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="navbar container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">📚 Studix01</a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/subjects">Subjects</a></li>
        <li><a href="/lessons">Lessons</a></li>
        <li><a href="/quizzes">Quizzes</a></li>
      </ul>
      <button id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle">🌙</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="card">
        <span class="badge badge-primary"><%= lesson.class %></span>
        <h1 style="margin-top: 1rem;"><%= lesson.title %></h1>
        <div class="lesson-meta" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          <span>📘 <%= lesson.subject %></span>
          <span>📊 <%= lesson.level %></span>
          <span>👀 <%= lesson.views %> views</span>
          <span>❤️ <%= lesson.likes %> likes</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 2rem; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--text-dark);">
          <p><strong>Lesson summary:</strong> This lesson introduces key concepts and practical ideas to help students understand the topic deeply and apply it in school assessments.</p>
          <p><strong>Key concepts:</strong> Definitions, examples, diagrams, and guided exercises are included to support active learning.</p>
          <p><strong>Study tip:</strong> Read carefully, take notes, practice exercises, and revise the main ideas before your next test.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lesson-actions" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="likeLessom(<%= lesson.id %>)">Like Lesson</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="saveLessom(<%= lesson.id %>)">Save Lesson</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="shareLessom('<%= lesson.title %>')">Share</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-bottom container">
      <p>© 2024 Studix01.net</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>














































